@IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7074

GET {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

###

# @name antiforgery
GET {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/api/security/antiforgery-token
Accept: application/json

###

# Run the antiforgery request first. The HTTP client must retain its Set-Cookie
# value for this request; only the JSON requestToken is copied into the header.
POST {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery.response.body.$.requestToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=IndependentApprovalBoundary

--IndependentApprovalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="antiforgery-test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Antiforgery-protected document upload test.
--IndependentApprovalBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Uploaded from IndependentApproval.Api.http
--IndependentApprovalBoundary--

###

GET {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{IndependentApproval.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

###
